WEBVTT

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.080
Rikukin-sama?

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.940
Let me handle this.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:16.180
Today I'll kill those heretics, 
even if it costs me my own life.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.910
I wish I could've finished off the 
last remaining Sorcerer here.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.530
Are you talking about me?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.610
Natsuka?

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.590
Now, then...

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.930
You guys finish off the old man.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.030
That's a relief.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:48.650
I was nearing my limit.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:52.140
Kounei, you win.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.370
If you want to plunge 
my heart into darkness,

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:59.220
I'll leap into it for you!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.480
<i>The months that pass within my dreams</i>

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.400
<i>I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair</i>

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:38.660
<i>If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes</i>

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:44.120
<i>In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world</i>

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:48.000
<i>Shangri-la is nowhere to be found</i>

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:53.800
<i>No one knows the love of the spring wind</i>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:03.010
<i>The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over</i>

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:10.980
<i>Trading places, they bloom then wilt</i>

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.820
<i>In January, I pick a flower with no petals</i>

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:22.160
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.660
<i>In March, the peach blossoms bloom</i>

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:33.630
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:37.670
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.760
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:51.770
<b>20:  Intent                 to Kill</b>

00:02:52.310 --> 00:03:10.710
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.270
Natsuka, please.

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:56.690
Leave this place.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:03.120
What's so bad about the 
time you spent with me?

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.660
Why are you determined 
to make yourself suffer?

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.720
Because you changed.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.460
You became a Zensei heretic,

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.410
and you... you...

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.010
M-Master, how did you find us?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.090
Reigyoku.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.410
Master, she, um...

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.140
Is this your girlfriend?

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.750
Please don't, Master!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.250
She's not! She's, uh...

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.970
Give up, Natsuka.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.210
My master sensed his student was 
in danger and came to save me.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.530
You don't stand a chance against him.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.750
Leave this mountain immediately!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:07.900
No, I just happened to be in the area.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.180
Master!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.220
Natsuka, what are you doing?

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:27.950
I see. So this is Zensei's 
"Bone Scraper Natsuka."

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:32.750
Well? Do you think your lust 
spells will work on me?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.520
I'm impressed, Tenshi.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.350
I underestimated you.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.720
Natsuka?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.710
Reigyoku.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.580
Yes?

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:54.070
Head to the other side of the 
mountain and help the apprentices.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.790
But Rikukin-sama has fallen 
into the enemy's trap.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.200
I know.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:04.390
I came here because I sensed 
his murderous intent.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.730
Master, I will—

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.570
This is beyond your abilities.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:12.650
Let me handle this.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.450
Now go.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.900
Y-Yes, Master.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:21.100
You're a rather bold girl.

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:25.970
You're not going to try to run from me?

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:33.530
I doubt I can escape unless you let me.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.560
Those legs are yours.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:43.150
Go or don't go? Which path will you take?

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.890
You must decide that for yourself.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:51.490
Become a heretic or live as a decent person?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.310
What kind of person you'll 
become works the same way.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:03.770
I was wondering how smart you were, 
since you became the Tenshi.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.720
You say some pretty stupid things.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:12.380
The way you live is mostly 
determined by others.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.680
You're right.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:22.870
But you can't walk the 
path you want to follow.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:26.020
You can't become the person you want to be.

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:29.580
Nothing goes the way you want.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.350
You remain bound.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.290
It's foolish.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:41.950
Not following your heart 
won't set your body free.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.910
You should think on it carefully.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.590
Such strength...

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.730
At this rate, he'll kill us.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.910
Jinchuu. Jinchuu!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.210
It's no use. We don't stand a chance 
against Rikukin in that state.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.940
What are you going to do, Kounei?

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.940
You can't seriously expect us to 
wait until he uses up his strength.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:40.080
For the time being, that's our only option.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.240
He's been overwhelmed by his rage.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.640
It'll take some time for him 
to switch to another emotion.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.810
Patiently waiting is our best option.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:56.910
Have you forgotten that time 
is not something we have?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.120
We need to hurry.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.210
You look awful.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:15.000
Shall we take a picture to 
commemorate this, Rikukin?

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:51.120
There's no point in hiding now.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:58.070
The moment I arrived, I felt my 
meridian system destabilize.

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:03.170
That must have been you, Kounei of Raienhou.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:08.550
Would you be willing to take a cue 
from the situation and leave?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:13.200
It will take some time to deal with Rikukin.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:17.630
But if you insist on interfering,

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.380
then I will kill you.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.760
Everybody run!

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.970
I wish you hadn't done that.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:05.120
We can't shamelessly retreat.

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:09.200
If we don't kill Rikukin now, then when?

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:13.880
One wrong move, and everyone 
here would've been dead.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:18.690
The Tenshi bears us no ill will.

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:24.340
But if we continue to interfere, 
he will definitely kill us.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:30.250
His murderous intent wasn't strong, 
but it was unbelievably pure.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:35.080
There was no hesitation in his emotion.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.020
You're exaggerating.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.010
I'm not.

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:45.560
I can destroy anyone's spirit 
inside my Juuni Roujoujin.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.950
It's like bending a wire.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:52.720
I was using my technique on 
the Tenshi the whole time,

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:58.440
and his spirit felt more like 
a steel pillar than a wire.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.010
This isn't good.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:09.130
The Tenshi and Rikukin have begun fighting.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.330
Let's get out of here.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.730
We're not getting our 
hands on the Tsuutenroku.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.640
There's no point in staying here.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.760
Hold on.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.800
We'll start once I've taken a picture.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:35.560
Unbelievable. Throwing 
talismans around like beans...

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:39.980
Won't scattering so many 
reduce their strength?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.200
You're not of the Furoku style.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.590
It's merely a copied technique.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:55.140
And now you're using your 
Goraifu against me.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:59.690
Don't you think that's a bit cruel, Rikukin?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.040
I see.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:27.970
<i>His Zujueyin Ganjingxue and Shoushaoyin 
Xinjinxue have surrendered,</i>

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.550
<i>causing his evil ki to spike.</i>

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:35.270
<i>Passing through the two meridians, 
it's entered his brain.</i>

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:39.890
<i>His mind is controlled by evil ki, 
which has broken his spirit.</i>

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:44.690
<i>In order to release him from his 
evil ki without harming him,</i>

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:50.410
<i>I'll have to use that technique 
passed down from Tenshi to Tenshi.</i>

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:56.490
I'm eternally grateful to the 
knowledge of the legendary wizards.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:59.760
Taijou Daisei.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.720
Ouhen Mutei.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.820
Kuja Bakumi.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.730
Homei Goshin.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.730
Chie Myoujou.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.920
Shinshin Anmei.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.040
Sankon Eikyuu.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.230
Hakumu Soukei.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:20.140
If this single attack doesn't 
bring you to your senses,

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.180
blame your fate.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.600
Now come, Rikukin.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.070
Come, Rikukin.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.200
I'm waiting here.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.930
Come and kill me.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:44.880
Ukonsei, I'll kill you with my own hands!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:56.940
Soran-kun.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:01.890
Did you decide not to succeed the Tenshi?

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:06.920
We made it this far, 
but it was all for nothing.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.620
No. I'll explain everything once we're home.

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.500
Right now, finding Hou-nee comes first.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.910
Can't we call the rest of the Express 
Delivery Company and look for her together?

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:20.700
We can't.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.140
They may discover the secret 
of Houhou's immortality.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.580
We have to search for her alone.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.670
Then let's split up.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.540
It's not efficient for 
us to search together.

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:36.320
But you're the one Zensei's after.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:37.210
No.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:42.160
They're probably more interested in Hou-nee.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.800
I underestimated them.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:48.850
If I'd predicted this when they acquired 
my memories of my grandfather...

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.590
Don't worry about me.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.810
I can fight on my own.

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.490
Soran-kun, don't hesitate.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.750
Otherwise you'll be killed.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:03.330
Yeah, I know.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.560
Wait!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.010
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.470
You're Chou Soran.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.970
Let's leave that kid and get out of here.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.350
Do you want the Tenshi to beat you up again?

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.540
This is perfect.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.360
I wanted to get back at that old fart.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:13.060
I'll kill the disciple he adores so much.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.150
Kinkouju!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.420
<i>I couldn't block it with my Kinkouju?</i>

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.310
<i>But it's slow.</i>

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.420
<i>I can fight while dodging them.</i>

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.310
<i>He's actually trying to kill me.</i>

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:35.550
<i>He's not too strong for me to handle.</i>

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.300
<i>I can use him...</i>

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.020
You're one tough brat.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.900
<i>It's no use. I don't think I can do it.</i>

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:52.950
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:55.720
<i>I need to put more pressure on myself.</i>

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.240
Just fall over already!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.240
Die!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:06.680
<i>Put myself on the edge of life and death.</i>

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:16.430
<i>I'm accustomed to fighting now.</i>

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.160
<i>But...</i>

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.830
<i>Can I not do it?</i>

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.120
<i>My pulse has quickened.</i>

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.980
<i>The moment I tried to kill him, 
my head went blank.</i>

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.580
<i>My hand's still shaking.</i>

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:41.530
<i>Calmly killing my opponent with 
a single blow isn't that easy.</i>

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:46.970
<i>But from now on, I'll be 
in more battles like this.</i>

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:53.200
<i>I need to become a full-fledged fighter 
and get used to life-threatening battles.</i>

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:57.320
<i>I don't have time to spare.</i>

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.210
Whoa, don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:04.780
I don't want to fight you.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.380
I just want to carry him home.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.880
He still seems to be breathing.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.400
Do what you want.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:22.070
<i>I hesitated during that fight.</i>

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:29.840
<i>If I fight an equal, the difference in our 
mental states will put me at a disadvantage.</i>

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:35.660
<i>My pulse quickens, my body 
shakes, and I feel sick.</i>

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.600
<i>That's a normal reaction.</i>

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.840
<i>Killing another person is...</i>

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:46.610
<i>But I can't afford to say that.</i>

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:51.780
<i>No matter what it takes, I need to change</i>

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:55.620
<i>from ordinary college student to warrior.</i>

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.780
<i>Damn. Zensei's everywhere.</i>

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:09.100
<i>Where are you, Hou-nee?</i>

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.540
<i>That's...</i>

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.160
<i>Riku Rinron?</i>

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.700
That's why I warned you

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.850
not to follow me.

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.690
My allies are all over the mountain.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.870
Pursuing me was your mistake.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:44.990
It seems Rikukin wasn't expecting 
us to attack with so many men.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:49.440
We didn't just come here to steal something.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.580
When he learns his great-granddaughter's 
been captured,

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.500
what do you think he'll do?

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:59.880
I'm sure he'll tell us how to 
get the Tsuutenroku then.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.930
Trade two women for the Tsuutenroku?

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:03.930
Stop it!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.700
That's not a fair trade.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.090
Help...

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.550
No! Let go!

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.690
Stop!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.730
Rinron, help!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.690
Isn't she your friend?

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.910
You don't want to see her 
suffer any more, do you?

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:31.290
If you'll come quietly, we won't hurt her.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.040
Rinron, please! Help me!

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.860
Rinron!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:41.720
Calm down. Hana-chan, I know you understand.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:47.970
Do you actually think we'll be 
spared if we give in to them?

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:52.950
No matter how much it hurts, 
grit your teeth and endure it.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:57.180
Haven't we been prepared for this

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:01.360
since the day we decided to 
fight back against Zensei?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.780
You're my friend, 
and you're important to me.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:12.280
But I'm not strong enough 
to promise I'll save you.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:15.400
There's one thing I can say, though...

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:19.640
If anything happens to you,

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:25.420
it'll be after they've beaten and killed me.

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.550
You must get it now.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:34.420
If capturing Rikukin's great-granddaughter 
would've gotten us the Tsuutenroku,

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:36.270
we would've done it long ago.

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:42.340
The word "compromise" isn't found 
in the Riku family dictionary.

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:22.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:24.530
Someone help!

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:27.830
Damn. Riku Rinron and Tsuu 
Kinka are in trouble.

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:30.460
I'll pretend I didn't see them.

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:31.800
Help us, you jerk!

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.070
Goodbye!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:34.050
Hey!

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:37.200
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Miracle."

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>21:                Miracle</b>

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:38.480
Don't miss it.
